OL,3,GNEWSAGrowing congestion could leave
OL,4,Atown 'strangled'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvesham residents say they have huge
OL,7,Fconcerns about traffic congestion, with
OL,8,Fone adding that if it continues it will
OL,9,F"strangle the town".
OL,11,FEwan Morgan has lived in the town for
OL,12,Fthree years and said: "Something has
OL,13,Fgot to be done because if [traffic]
OL,14,Fincreases at this rate, it will just
OL,15,Fkill off tourism and strangle the
OL,16,Ftown."
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
