OL,3,GNEWSAGrowing congestion could leave
OL,4,Atown 'strangled'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have now called for an
OL,7,Finvestigation to be launched over how
OL,8,Fto ease tailbacks. The town's
OL,9,Fcongestion issues along High Street
OL,10,Fhave been a growing concern over the
OL,11,Flast decade.
OL,13,FA notice of motion calling for a
OL,14,F12-month action plan to be drawn up is
OL,15,Fdue to be discussed on Thursday by
OL,16,FWorcestershire County Council.
